  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "（はふう、あったかぁい……。ようやく落ちついたなぁ、）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 38,
    "dress": "old-bath",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-bath_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "（いやまぁ『ほっ』としてる場合じゃないけど。慌てても、しょうがないもんね）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 38,
    "dress": "old-bath",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-bath_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "（よかった、先輩に保護してもらえて。やっぱり、先輩は頼もしいなぁ……♪）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 38,
    "dress": "old-bath",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-bath_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "（ゲームセンターで、いきなり身体がぐんぐん縮んじゃって。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "（わたし、なぜかお人形さんとまちがえられたらしくて……？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "（店員さんが何を勘違いしたのか、わたしをクレーンゲームの景品だと思って……。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 38,
    "dress": "old-bath",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-bath_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "（筐体のなかに、放りこんだんだよね）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 38,
    "dress": "old-bath",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-bath_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "（うう。ゲームのなかには入ってみたかったけど、そういう意味じゃない）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 38,
    "dress": "old-bath",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-bath_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "（あの店員さん、絶対にゆるさないよ。ゲーセンの『お客さまの声』に悪し様に書いてやる、）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "（勤務態度が怠慢だとか……。まぁ、それは元のおおきさに戻ってから）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 38,
    "dress": "old-bath",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-bath_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "（戻れるのかなぁ、一生このままだったらどうしよう……。ううん、だいじょうぶ。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 38,
    "dress": "old-bath",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-bath_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "（先輩も、なつみさんも、ちからになってくれる。こういうこと、ゲームではよくあるし）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 38,
    "dress": "old-bath",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-bath_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "（攻略法を見つけて、元のおおきさに戻ってみせる。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 38,
    "dress": "old-bath",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-bath_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "（こんなお人形サイズじゃ、先輩と抱きあったりキスしたりするのも難しいよ……。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 38,
    "dress": "old-bath",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-bath_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "（いやうん、そんな予定はないけど）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "set_still_image",
    "id": "card/normal/1276"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「ゆきちゃん、湯加減はどう？　ぬるすぎたり熱すぎたら言ってね、温度を調整するからね～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 38,
    "dress": "old-bath",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-bath_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「ひぃっ、巨人!?」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「巨人じゃないもん！　ごめんね、驚かせちゃって……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「今のゆきちゃんは『ちっちゃい』んだもんね、わたしがデカく見えちゃっても仕方ないよねっ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 38,
    "dress": "old-bath",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-bath_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「あうう……。すみません、なつみさん。あんまり、近くで大声ださないでください。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「このサイズ比だとなつみさんの息が暴風だし、声が全身に『びりびり』響くんです」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 38,
    "dress": "old-bath",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-bath_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「あわわっ、なつみさんが歩くだけで揺れる！　ほとんど地震っ、怖い～！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「こういう漫画を読んだことあるっ、巨人に食べられちゃうやつ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「ご、ごめん。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「んっとね、おうちから子供のころよく『おままごと』に使ってたお人形さんの服とかもってきたんだ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「よかったら、あとで着てね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「サイズとかあわなかったら、わたしが手縫いでつくっちゃうから」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 38,
    "dress": "old-bath",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-bath_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「あ、ありがとうございます。何から何まで……。このお風呂も、ちょうどいい湯加減です。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「えへへ、お茶のカップで入浴するなんて夢みたい～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "（ていうか。ちょっと、目玉の親父さんみたいだなぁ……？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 38,
    "dress": "old-bath",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-bath_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「ほんとに感謝しちゃいます、なつみさん。お洋服、どうしようかと思ってたので」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「もともと着てたやつも、転校生の先輩たちが回収してくれたんですけど。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 38,
    "dress": "old-bath",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-bath_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「さすがに、サイズ的にぜんぜん着られないし」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「うん。他にも必要なものがあったら、どんどん言ってね～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「えへへ。どんな服が着たいかな、ゆきちゃん？　普段は着られないような服とか、いっぱいあるよ～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「お人形さんむかし好きだったから、衣装も種類が豊富なんだ～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「『お仕事シリーズ』とかあって、バスガイドさんにナースさんにコックさん！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「あとね～、ドレスも選り取りみどり♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「えっへっへ。憧れの、生きて動いてお喋りできる着せ替え人形だぁああ……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 38,
    "dress": "old-bath",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-bath_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「な、なつみさん。ちょっとコワいです、あんまりおおきく動かないでください。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「この体格差だと、ふつうに踏まれただけで死にますのでわたし」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「あはは、ごめんごめん。ゆきちゃんにとっては深刻な事態だもんね、面白がっちゃ駄目だよね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「まずは、ゆっくり入浴してね～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「憧れのミルク風呂とか、やっちゃう？　でも牛乳を浴びたら、生臭くなっちゃうかな～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「お菓子もつくっちゃおっと、ほんとに『お菓子の家』を体験できちゃうよ～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 38,
    "dress": "old-bath",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-bath_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「あのう、ティータイムの準備をしないでください。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「真面目に、なつみさんに食べられちゃうような気がしてきました」"
  },
